    "updated_at": "2024-01-15T09:05:11Z",
    "body": "`overflow` has changed in Gecko and Chromium. See https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1597553#c1\r\n\r\n> Gecko has changed to `overflow: clip !important`\r\n> https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/961a9e56a0b5fa96ceef22c61c5e75fb6ba53395/layout/style/res/forms.css#531\r\n> I think changed by https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1800077 (but the spec was only for buttons).\r\n>\r\n> Chromium has changed to `overflow: hidden !important`\r\n> https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/resources/html.css;l=650?q=html.css&ss=chromium\r\n> Commit https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/21fca6496a9a5af87213ec4d49e043fb6240355d",
